OL,3,GNEWSABuilding of 180 homes to start on
OL,4,Aold Debenhams site
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe development of a "long-vacant"
OL,7,Fformer Debenhams site in Surrey is set
OL,8,Fto resume as a developer confirmed a
OL,9,Fdeal was struck to raise extra funds.
OL,11,FProperty developer Native Land said
OL,12,F#132m of funding was needed to advance
OL,13,Fthe 180-home development at its St
OL,14,FMary's Wharf site in Guildford.
OL,16,FIts main construction phase will begin
OL,17,F"in the coming weeks", with demolition,
OL,18,Fmajor groundworks and environmental
OL,19,Fsafeguards having already taken place,
OL,20,Fthe developer said.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
